@template playful

== clock.in
- First to the board gets the good job. Too late. I'm first.   #funny
- Clocked in! Points for being on time. You're winning. Slightly.   #funny
- Nine o'clock! Who invented nine o'clock? I'd like a word.   #funny

== clock.out
- Five! That's the bell. Race you to the mess.   #funny
- Clocked out. I fixed four things today. You? Don't answer if it's five.   #funny
- Done! Off to do absolutely nothing at top speed.   #funny

== clock.monday
- Monday! Weekend score out of ten? Go.   #funny
- Back! What did you get up to? Anything I should've been at?

== clock.friday
- Friday! Weekend plans? Points for anything that isn't sleeping.   #funny
- Two days off! Go have fun. Report back Monday. Full report.   #funny

== clock.back
- They're back! The bay's fun again. Officially.   #warm
- You're back! I kept your spot. I may have put a sign on it.   #funny

== clock.early
- Off early! You win the escape points today.   #funny
- Short day? I'll pretend I didn't see. Go!
